# CDP/QA scratch. The visual-QA probes drive a headless Chrome with its own
# --user-data-dir; when one is launched with a RELATIVE output path it lands
# here instead of in the scratchpad, and `git add -A` will happily commit a
# 15 MB browser profile (231 files, once).
shots*/

# Reference material saved from other sites (saved-page HTML + its _files dir).
# Kept locally to work from, never committed: it is someone else's markup and
# assets, and a saved page drags in a few MB of js/css/images.
examples/
